{"id":"wb-6-243","name":"冯素弗墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北燕馮素弗墓","text":"北燕冯素弗墓，位于中华人民共和国辽宁省朝阳市北票市西官营镇，是十六国时期北燕国开国重臣、王室冯素弗及其妻属的墓葬。2006年5月25日，获中国国务院公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。其所出土的鸭形玻璃注则在2002年1月18日，获中国国家文物局公布为首批禁止出境展览文物。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E7%87%95%E9%A6%AE%E7%B4%A0%E5%BC%97%E5%A2%93","revisionId":94133821,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94133821","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8b7d0051d9aa6f6c2fce4fd2.jpg","title":"20260820 Glass Bowl.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260820_Glass_Bowl.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/20260820_Glass_Bowl.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​玻璃碗，十六国北燕，北燕冯素弗墓出土，辽宁省博物馆藏，于郑州商都遗址博物院“龙城之金——辽宁三燕文物精品展”展出。","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应百科配图的名称与所在地一致"}}